WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.627
This slide brings Module 5 together.

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:06.407
Review the patterns you can now recognize and reuse.

00:00:06.407 --> 00:00:12.117
Focus on the decisions behind the syntax: what structure or method fits the problem,

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.737
what assumptions are being made, and what you should check before trusting the result.

00:00:16.737 --> 00:00:19.102
Choose the structure based on meaning.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:24.367
Use dictionaries for labeled fields and sets for uniqueness or membership.

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:29.382
A good data structure makes later code shorter and easier to reason about.

00:00:29.382 --> 00:00:35.142
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:35.142 --> 00:00:40.560
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
